      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789888001535,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Features :- \n1. Authentication\n\n2. Search Order\n    Search by Order ID\n    Search by Mobile\n    Search by Name\n    Search by Email\n    Search button\n    Empty/loading/error states\n\n3.  Order Details\n    Order Date\n    Order ID\n    Payment Mode\n    Buyer Details\n    Order Total\n\n4. Order Items\n    Product Image\n    Product Name\n    Model\n    Price\n    Quantity\n    Discount\n    Delivery Charges\n    Item-level Status\n        Pending\n        Processing\n        Shipped\n        Fulfilled\n        Cancelled\n\n5. Order Actions\nTrack Order\nGenerate Invoice\nView Order Details\n    \n6. Business Logic\nItem Total =\n(price × quantity) - discount + deliveryCharges\n\nOrder Total =\nΣ Item Total   ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Features :- \n1. Authentication\n\n2. Search Order\n    Search by Order ID\n    Search by Mobile\n    Search by Name\n    Search by Email\n    Search button\n    Empty/loading/error states\n\n3.  Order Details\n    Order Date\n    Order ID\n    Payment Mode\n    Buyer Details\n    Order Total\n\n4. Order Items\n    Product Image\n    Product Name\n    Model\n    Price\n    Quantity\n    Discount\n    Delivery Charges\n    Item-level Status\n        Pending\n        Processing\n        Shipped\n        Fulfilled\n        Cancelled\n\n5. Order Actions\nTrack Order\nGenerate Invoice\nView Order Details\n    \n6. Business Logic\nItem Total =\n(price × quantity) - discount + deliveryCharges\n\nOrder Total =\nΣ Item Total   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
